Package: pyright
Architecture: all
Depends: nodejs (>= 14), ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: python3
Description: static type checker and language server for Python
 Pyright is a full-featured, standards-based static type checker for
 Python, designed for high performance and for use with large source
 bases.
 .
 This package provides the pyright command-line type checker and the
 pyright-langserver language server (LSP), for use with editors such as
 Vim, Neovim, Emacs, Helix or Kate.
 .
 It bundles the typeshed stubs and the JavaScript libraries pyright
 depends on.
